# TURNIP TRUCK: BRINE BURST. The hydrants stand at the kerbs of the
# crossings and spray brine across the road in turn, shoving the truck;
# waves of brine sweep across three roads towards the brine beside them, and
# a truck near the downstream edge is swept in, while one by the upstream
# kerb only slides. None of it hurts by itself.
seed 5
game turnip
wait 5
expect pipes_at_kerb == 1
cheat day 3 1
cheat notraffic
expect event == 1
# in the spray of the hydrant at the crossing (5, 5)
waituntil spray_dir2 >= 0 240
cheat stop
cheat inspray 2 20
wait 20
expect speed100 > 20
expect hearts == 3
# the works' street at row 24: a wave crosses it northwards towards the channel
cheat stop
cheat pos 300 1162
cheat ang 0
waituntil push100 > 0 300
waituntil falls >= 1 120
# by the upstream (south) kerb it only slides the truck along
waituntil tstate == 0 120
cheat stop
cheat pos 300 1196
cheat ang 0
cheat inv 100
waituntil push100 > 0 300
wait 60
expect falls == 1
expect y < 1192
# no brine on a quiet day
cheat day 3 0
cheat pos 264 300
cheat stop
wait 60
expect push100 == 0
